#Spiced nuts

## Ingredients

2 cups nuts   - cashews, walnuts, whatever
1 tsp chili powder
1 1/2 tsp paprika powder  / or curry
2 tsp honey
1 tbsp lemon juice (or lime)
1 tsp olive oil
1 tsp salt


## Method

-Preheat oven to 175C
-Toss ingredients together in a large bowl
-Spread on a baking sheet and bake for approx. 20 min (turn halfway, or more often depending on oven)
